            <body>If false, managing the SSM Information on the transmit direction (represented by the sentSsmInformation, sentSsmMode and sentSsmConfigurationValue attributes) is not supported by the device.</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="pathmap://UML_LIBRARIES/UMLPrimitiveTypes.library.uml#Boolean"/>
