            <body>Defines whether the clock port is accessible from external of the device. The externalClockPort attribute is indicating the synch port to be either of type 2MHz/2Mbit (if true) or traffic port (if false).</body>
          </ownedComment>
          <type xmi:type="uml:PrimitiveType" href="pathmap://UML_LIBRARIES/UMLPrimitiveTypes.library.uml#Boolean"/>
          <defaultValue xmi:type="uml:LiteralBoolean" xmi:id="_lZ2PsmUPEe6RRoZoYAvn4A"/>
        </ownedAttribute>
